'''Michael Robert Baldassin''' (born July 26, 1955) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[linebacker]] for two seasons with the [[San Francisco 49ers]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Washington Huskies football|Washington Huskies]].
